---
description: UI component standards.
alwaysApply: true
---

# UI Components

Every UI component should be reusable.

---

# Component Categories

UI

Business

Layout

Section

Feature

Never mix responsibilities.

---

# Reusability

Before creating a component,

search existing components.

Never duplicate.

---

# Props

Keep props minimal.

Avoid passing unnecessary data.

---

# Composition

Prefer composition over inheritance.

---

# Variants

Use variants instead of duplicated components.

Example:

Button

Primary

Secondary

Ghost

Outline

Danger

Never create ButtonPrimary, ButtonSecondary, etc.

---

# Styling

Follow design tokens.

Never hardcode values.

---

# Accessibility

Every component should support keyboard interaction.

---

# Documentation

Reusable components should include usage examples.

---

# Goal

Build a scalable component library.